## What this run built

- Cloudflare Worker (Hono) + Vite/React/Tailwind PWA scaffold, wrangler.toml
  with a habit-db D1 binding, vitest-pool-workers test harness.
- Full D1 schema (all 12 CLAUDE.md §12 tables), cascading deletes verified.
- Full habit library seeded: 364 habits across all 12 categories, a Zod
  validator, and an idempotent seed loader.
- Complete magic-link auth flow: request-link (rate limited, hashed
  tokens) -> callback (single-use, creates/fetches user, sets session
  cookie) -> requireAuth middleware -> protected GET /api/me, with the
  multi-tenancy rule enforced and tested (user A cannot read user B's data).
- Installable PWA shell: manifest, service worker, self-hosted rounded
  fonts, Mascot component, a sign-in screen driving the whole auth flow.
- Full verification sweep (build + test + validate:library) green in one
  invocation; 26 tests passing across 8 files.

